(393420, 34146, 6804, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful capture. You might try playing with your crop tool &amp; settings to see if you can get a cleaner edge on your photo. (see the light line before the black border) - good luck - 6</td>', 'This is a beautiful capture. You might try playing with your crop tool & settings to see if you can get a cleaner edge on your photo. (see the light line before the black border) - good luck - 6', '2003-08-20 01:20:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(393421, 34286, 3554, '<td valign="top">I think if you focused more on the grill it would help. The background is kind of ugly with the dying flowers. I think the coals are the strong point, you might have tried to highlight them more. Perhaps a lower camera angle as well.</td>', 'I think if you focused more on the grill it would help. The background is kind of ugly with the dying flowers. I think the coals are the strong point, you might have tried to highlight them more. Perhaps a lower camera angle as well.', '2003-08-20 01:21:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(393422, 34338, 3554, '<td valign="top">A bit more flame would have added color and spiced this photo up a bit.</td>', 'A bit more flame would have added color and spiced this photo up a bit.', '2003-08-20 01:22:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(393423, 34358, 11346, '<td valign="top">Excellent color, stunning. 10</td>', 'Excellent color, stunning. 10', '2003-08-20 01:23:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(393424, 34391, 3554, '<td valign="top">One thing I like in this photo is the dazzling effect on the car windshield in the distance. Something about the focus (or lack thereof) detracts from the effect. I do like how long the path streches out...helps emphasize a long hot day.</td>', 'One thing I like in this photo is the dazzling effect on the car windshield in the distance. Something about the focus (or lack thereof) detracts from the effect. I do like how long the path streches out...helps emphasize a long hot day.', '2003-08-20 01:23:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(393427, 33584, 6804, '<td valign="top">This is a great capture. The fuzzy border is a little bothersome,  It looks like you might have given this a border and then re-sized the image.  Try sizing first and borders last. - Nice work 7</td>', 'This is a great capture. The fuzzy border is a little bothersome,  It looks like you might have given this a border and then re-sized the image.  Try sizing first and borders last. - Nice work 7', '2003-08-20 01:24:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(393436, 34341, 3554, '<td valign="top">I would really like this shot if it werent in the rearview mirror. I''ve seen quite a few of these (rearview mirror) shots and I just don''t understand the appeal. I especially don''t like the car in the background or the white line under the mirror.</td>', 'I would really like this shot if it werent in the rearview mirror. I''ve seen quite a few of these (rearview mirror) shots and I just don''t understand the appeal. I especially don''t like the car in the background or the white line under the mirror.', '2003-08-20 01:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(393437, 34287, 3554, '<td valign="top">I don''t really understand why you put summer in the title. Doesn''t affect my vote but are there such things as "summer" hummingbirds?  Aren''t they just regular hummingbirds? Alternatives: Summer Guest; Hummingbird;</td>', 'I don''t really understand why you put summer in the title. Doesn''t affect my vote but are there such things as "summer" hummingbirds?  Aren''t they just regular hummingbirds? Alternatives: Summer Guest; Hummingbird;', '2003-08-20 01:29:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(393442, 34313, 3554, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. A couple nit picks: I might have gotten rid of the stick standing up in the foreground, I think it detracts from the cracks which are the real strength of your shot. Lighting is a bit drab as well maybe shoot at dawn or sunset?</td>', 'Nicely done. A couple nit picks: I might have gotten rid of the stick standing up in the foreground, I think it detracts from the cracks which are the real strength of your shot. Lighting is a bit drab as well maybe shoot at dawn or sunset?', '2003-08-20 01:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(393444, 34246, 6804, '<td valign="top">Very unusual effect here. It looks like a cartoon. Great work, I''m not sure I would crop her feet off here.  - good luck</td>', 'Very unusual effect here. It looks like a cartoon. Great work, I''m not sure I would crop her feet off here.  - good luck', '2003-08-20 01:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(393445, 34333, 3554, '<td valign="top">I love this shot. Title, everything about it works for me. This is the kind of shot I want to take some day.  I''m guessing this is done with a DSLR.</td>', 'I love this shot. Title, everything about it works for me. This is the kind of shot I want to take some day.  I''m guessing this is done with a DSLR.', '2003-08-20 01:35:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(393446, 34245, 11379, '<td valign="top">man oh man, i love infrared :)</td>', 'man oh man, i love infrared :)', '2003-08-20 01:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(393448, 33878, 3554, '<td valign="top">I don''t care for your title it doesn''t help me relate the shot to a season.  Not a bad shot though. It feels like summer to me. In my mind the boy on his trike correlates to a farmer on a 4-wheeler, driving out to check irrigation or mend a fence or something.</td>', 'I don''t care for your title it doesn''t help me relate the shot to a season.  Not a bad shot though. It feels like summer to me. In my mind the boy on his trike correlates to a farmer on a 4-wheeler, driving out to check irrigation or mend a fence or something.', '2003-08-20 01:37:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(393449, 34314, 3554, '<td valign="top">Peaceful and summer-y.  I like it.</td>', 'Peaceful and summer-y.  I like it.', '2003-08-20 01:38:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(393452, 34265, 3554, '<td valign="top">I can feel the heat. Nice work. I really like the placement of the horizon I feel like I''m standing at the fence myself.</td>', 'I can feel the heat. Nice work. I really like the placement of the horizon I feel like I''m standing at the fence myself.', '2003-08-20 01:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(393455, 34100, 3554, '<td valign="top">Definitely hit the challenge but the shot lacks a focal point. I''d like something to latch on to. A colorful umbrella or an intersting person. Or something. Kind of feels like a lot of background but no subject.</td>', 'Definitely hit the challenge but the shot lacks a focal point. I''d like something to latch on to. A colorful umbrella or an intersting person. Or something. Kind of feels like a lot of background but no subject.', '2003-08-20 01:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(393456, 33509, 10263, '<td valign="top"><br/> <br/> <br/>Beautiful countryside. Looks like Oregon. I think it is just a little over exposed. Love the composition and it fits the subject. <br/> <br/> <br/></td>', '  Beautiful countryside. Looks like Oregon. I think it is just a little over exposed. Love the composition and it fits the subject.   ', '2003-08-20 01:42:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(393457, 34375, 3554, '<td valign="top">I can''t really say that this doesn''t meet the challenge but it just doesn''t grab me. It''s a perfectly acceptable photo but it lacks a wow factor or a common thread for me to grasp as the viewer.  Perhaps if the flowers were more interesting...maybe its that they are so green which seems antithetical to death?</td>', 'I can''t really say that this doesn''t meet the challenge but it just doesn''t grab me. It''s a perfectly acceptable photo but it lacks a wow factor or a common thread for me to grasp as the viewer.  Perhaps if the flowers were more interesting...maybe its that they are so green which seems antithetical to death?', '2003-08-20 01:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(393458, 33654, 3554, '<td valign="top">Interesting commentary on the wildfires we see in the West. A different side of summer that not everyone sees.</td>', 'Interesting commentary on the wildfires we see in the West. A different side of summer that not everyone sees.', '2003-08-20 01:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
