(394327, 34260, 4008, '<td valign="top">There is not much detail in the trees, slightly underexposed there, a curve in PS could solve that (I think it is allowed in DPC rules). The thumbnail jumped straight out. I love the colors and composition and how you made a simple scene in a very attractive picture. A 9 for now (but I might be back once I scored the rest).</td>', 'There is not much detail in the trees, slightly underexposed there, a curve in PS could solve that (I think it is allowed in DPC rules). The thumbnail jumped straight out. I love the colors and composition and how you made a simple scene in a very attractive picture. A 9 for now (but I might be back once I scored the rest).', '2003-08-20 12:37:06.000000', NULL, 1),
