(394424, 33462, 5822, '<td valign="top">I really like the noise and lighting in this shot, as well as, the soft focus and compositioin.  Simple, but very effective abstract.  I like the pastel effect of the background and the way the color graduates between a bluish purple on bottom and reddish orange on top.  I find this to be a very artsy picture.  However, I don''t believe that a play on words here meets the challenge requirements, and I also think a border would have been appropriate.</td>', 'I really like the noise and lighting in this shot, as well as, the soft focus and compositioin.  Simple, but very effective abstract.  I like the pastel effect of the background and the way the color graduates between a bluish purple on bottom and reddish orange on top.  I find this to be a very artsy picture.  However, I don''t believe that a play on words here meets the challenge requirements, and I also think a border would have been appropriate.', '2003-08-20 13:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(394428, 34359, 208, '<td valign="top">I like the near-silhouette, but the glare is just too harsh.</td>', 'I like the near-silhouette, but the glare is just too harsh.', '2003-08-20 13:32:57.000000', NULL, 1),
