(394620, 34254, 1143, '<td valign="top">make it BIGGER.. really, having a small pic will make some ppl give u a lower score automatically. I think the shot is cool, but can''t say much about the quality at this size. Keep in mind that some ppl also use different resolution monitors so use the full 640 you''re allowed. Great color and dof from what I can see.</td>', 'make it BIGGER.. really, having a small pic will make some ppl give u a lower score automatically. I think the shot is cool, but can''t say much about the quality at this size. Keep in mind that some ppl also use different resolution monitors so use the full 640 you''re allowed. Great color and dof from what I can see.', '2003-08-20 15:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
