(394623, 33372, 10788, '<td valign="top">I like this</td>', 'I like this', '2003-08-20 15:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(394624, 34044, 1143, '<td valign="top">The sun glare in the center is bothersome. Pros use lens hoods, but I use my hand to shade the lens.. or just find a different spot. Also a bit underexposed due to the direction of the sun. Interesting capture. Just spent the day in the Stockholm archipelago, and when I see this I think BRRRrrrrr  :)</td>', 'The sun glare in the center is bothersome. Pros use lens hoods, but I use my hand to shade the lens.. or just find a different spot. Also a bit underexposed due to the direction of the sun. Interesting capture. Just spent the day in the Stockholm archipelago, and when I see this I think BRRRrrrrr  :)', '2003-08-20 15:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(394625, 34140, 11370, '<td valign="top">This is a really beautiful pic.  You can almost imagine yourself there.</td>', 'This is a really beautiful pic.  You can almost imagine yourself there.', '2003-08-20 15:36:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(394627, 34245, 1143, '<td valign="top">I really like IR filters. Very cool look to this shot, esp the sky. I''d rather see it without all the distractions on the ground. They''re too small and far away to really add much IMO, and that beautiful tree is too centered. I like how the trees along the side frame it though.</td>', 'I really like IR filters. Very cool look to this shot, esp the sky. I''d rather see it without all the distractions on the ground. They''re too small and far away to really add much IMO, and that beautiful tree is too centered. I like how the trees along the side frame it though.', '2003-08-20 15:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(394628, 33462, 4008, '<td valign="top">no spring in the air ?</td>', 'no spring in the air ?', '2003-08-20 15:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(394629, 33648, 10788, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. Central horizon spoils it. Prefer 1/3rds.</td>', 'Nice idea. Central horizon spoils it. Prefer 1/3rds.', '2003-08-20 15:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(394630, 33285, 1143, '<td valign="top">cropped too tightly IMO. I''d prefer more space on the right side and bottom. Great texture and detail though. Nice lighting too. Getting a lit subject and all black background isn''t easy.</td>', 'cropped too tightly IMO. I''d prefer more space on the right side and bottom. Great texture and detail though. Nice lighting too. Getting a lit subject and all black background isn''t easy.', '2003-08-20 15:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(394633, 34307, 4008, '<td valign="top">great colors, crop a bit too tight 9</td>', 'great colors, crop a bit too tight 9', '2003-08-20 15:40:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(394637, 33539, 1143, '<td valign="top">It''s a bit noisy. High ISO? I''d ry neat image or something to help that and crop off the left and top some. The red flowers and bird are all that''s necessary. The rest is distracting. Nice capture!</td>', 'It''s a bit noisy. High ISO? I''d ry neat image or something to help that and crop off the left and top some. The red flowers and bird are all that''s necessary. The rest is distracting. Nice capture!', '2003-08-20 15:42:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(394644, 33393, 7969, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorite shots in this challenge.  I think it will likely get overlooked.  It is a very busy shot, which normally I find distracting, but here I like the contrasts.  The ages and skin of the men, the boats and the water.  I cant figure out what the curved line is at the top right, but it looks like the edge of the earth.   The water bottle almost emptied, the man sleeping, the other shirt off.  I think this is the kind of shot that would be in national geographic representing life in  ?  (the Mediterranean perhaps).   As far as criticisms go-- the dark skinned man could have slightly more light while the big jug could have slightly less.  None the less my choice for 1st place.  You have a great shot and captured something that is very human and ''summer''.  Excellent shot.</td>', 'This is one of my favorite shots in this challenge.  I think it will likely get overlooked.  It is a very busy shot, which normally I find distracting, but here I like the contrasts.  The ages and skin of the men, the boats and the water.  I cant figure out what the curved line is at the top right, but it looks like the edge of the earth.   The water bottle almost emptied, the man sleeping, the other shirt off.  I think this is the kind of shot that would be in national geographic representing life in  ?  (the Mediterranean perhaps).   As far as criticisms go-- the dark skinned man could have slightly more light while the big jug could have slightly less.  None the less my choice for 1st place.  You have a great shot and captured something that is very human and ''summer''.  Excellent shot.', '2003-08-20 15:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(394647, 33671, 1143, '<td valign="top">Just to clarify... Did you take this within the specified time frame? I just ask because I didn''t know they had snow in Holland in August.</td>', 'Just to clarify... Did you take this within the specified time frame? I just ask because I didn''t know they had snow in Holland in August.', '2003-08-20 15:49:16.000000', NULL, 1),
