(395183, 33813, 10799, '<td valign="top">This is unclear.  I can not really tell what you meant to show.  I see running, water over something.. maybe a rock  and a small leaf.  It might be too dark to see clearly.</td>', 'This is unclear.  I can not really tell what you meant to show.  I see running, water over something.. maybe a rock  and a small leaf.  It might be too dark to see clearly.', '2003-08-20 23:29:36.000000', NULL, 1),
