(395508, 34244, 11184, '<td valign="top">A winter shot!  And a beautiful one at that.  Love the depth and the people down the path.  Some might argue the bright white coat is a distraction against the lovely sepia tones, but I guess it also helps pull the eye "down under" the middle of the path in a cool way...I definitely like that there is something there anyway.  Great shot...I want to go to Australia!</td>', 'A winter shot!  And a beautiful one at that.  Love the depth and the people down the path.  Some might argue the bright white coat is a distraction against the lovely sepia tones, but I guess it also helps pull the eye "down under" the middle of the path in a cool way...I definitely like that there is something there anyway.  Great shot...I want to go to Australia!', '2003-08-22 00:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
