(395578, 34372, 11184, '<td valign="top">Hits ya here, hits ya here.  Although I am quite hungry all of a sudden, the problem I think with even trying shots like these is they reallllly have to be pretty perfect for them to work.  Just probably not going to be able to get that with an internal flash.</td>', 'Hits ya here, hits ya here.  Although I am quite hungry all of a sudden, the problem I think with even trying shots like these is they reallllly have to be pretty perfect for them to work.  Just probably not going to be able to get that with an internal flash.', '2003-08-22 02:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
