(395622, 33542, 11184, '<td valign="top">Ha!  I love it!  Clever.  I wonder how you could have gotten it to look even more "frying".  Great concept, really like the black and white, and love the cactuses, rocks, and the 2 extra eggs.  Might really want to get rid of that contrasting angle in the upper left corner though.</td>', 'Ha!  I love it!  Clever.  I wonder how you could have gotten it to look even more "frying".  Great concept, really like the black and white, and love the cactuses, rocks, and the 2 extra eggs.  Might really want to get rid of that contrasting angle in the upper left corner though.', '2003-08-22 02:55:15.000000', NULL, 1),
