(395669, 34293, 11184, '<td valign="top">Well....I guess its better than Kayopectate Park.  I took my kid Aquafina there once right before she graduated from Cheetos Jr. High over on Aunt Jamimah St.<br/>Sigh, and to think I am watching "The Sandlot" on HBO as I type this.<br/> <br/>''Tis a lovely shot though (and product endorsement), but might want to be careful of having those flowers crowd things.  As it is, the flowers are almost trying to take over as the main subject.   Plus, I think Minute Maid legally requires proper clearance for its signage on all photo reproductions.  You wouldn''t want to go to the Pepsi''s Court.  (yes I know Coke owns Minute Maid, but whats the difference) <br/></td>', 'Well....I guess its better than Kayopectate Park.  I took my kid Aquafina there once right before she graduated from Cheetos Jr. High over on Aunt Jamimah St.Sigh, and to think I am watching "The Sandlot" on HBO as I type this. ''Tis a lovely shot though (and product endorsement), but might want to be careful of having those flowers crowd things.  As it is, the flowers are almost trying to take over as the main subject.   Plus, I think Minute Maid legally requires proper clearance for its signage on all photo reproductions.  You wouldn''t want to go to the Pepsi''s Court.  (yes I know Coke owns Minute Maid, but whats the difference) ', '2003-08-22 04:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
