(396032, 33653, 11155, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot.  I especially like the background - it''s not cluttered with telephone wires or cars and such.  Very rural feeling to this.  Good focus, contrast, and colors.  Good luck!</td>', 'I really like this shot.  I especially like the background - it''s not cluttered with telephone wires or cars and such.  Very rural feeling to this.  Good focus, contrast, and colors.  Good luck!', '2003-08-22 12:10:20.000000', NULL, 1),
