(396047, 34359, 11155, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot.  I would say that the boy is underexposed, as is the ground, but I think you were going for a silhouette feel to this and I think that works fine.  Nice summery feel to this.  Good luck in the contest!</td>', 'Wonderful shot.  I would say that the boy is underexposed, as is the ground, but I think you were going for a silhouette feel to this and I think that works fine.  Nice summery feel to this.  Good luck in the contest!', '2003-08-22 12:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(396060, 33584, 11155, '<td valign="top">Wonderful macro shot.  Great focus, color, etc.  I guess even these guys need a drink when it''s hot, huh?  Good luck!</td>', 'Wonderful macro shot.  Great focus, color, etc.  I guess even these guys need a drink when it''s hot, huh?  Good luck!', '2003-08-22 12:21:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(396065, 34310, 11155, '<td valign="top">Haha, cute shot.  Well posed.  I like the pool in the background - had that been missing, I don''t think I would have liked this as much...  Good luck!</td>', 'Haha, cute shot.  Well posed.  I like the pool in the background - had that been missing, I don''t think I would have liked this as much...  Good luck!', '2003-08-22 12:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
