(396193, 34270, 9690, '<td valign="top">i like the fact that there is a bottle in the shot.  adds dimension and to the fact that the area is waterless....</td>', 'i like the fact that there is a bottle in the shot.  adds dimension and to the fact that the area is waterless....', '2003-08-22 13:50:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(396195, 34086, 9690, '<td valign="top">nice shot... never thought id say this, but great use of the color brown!!!</td>', 'nice shot... never thought id say this, but great use of the color brown!!!', '2003-08-22 13:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(396197, 33500, 9690, '<td valign="top">great colors!!!</td>', 'great colors!!!', '2003-08-22 13:50:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(396200, 34108, 9690, '<td valign="top">i really like this shot.  unique angle and capture... suprisingly, it conveys an emotion to me.</td>', 'i really like this shot.  unique angle and capture... suprisingly, it conveys an emotion to me.', '2003-08-22 13:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(396201, 33836, 9690, '<td valign="top">very unique.  nice use of color</td>', 'very unique.  nice use of color', '2003-08-22 13:52:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(396203, 33446, 9690, '<td valign="top">YIKES!  Love the title</td>', 'YIKES!  Love the title', '2003-08-22 13:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(396204, 34241, 10402, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of a double rainbow. I''ve seen these before, but never had a camera handy to try to photograph one. I like your composition here. The focal point is at the center about a third up from the bottom; the brightest spot where the arc of the main rainbow leads my eye. The second rainbow to the right is positioned perfectly to balance the lightness to the left. The fence keeps the foreground from being completely boring, but doesn''t become a focal point itself. Well done.</td>', 'Nice capture of a double rainbow. I''ve seen these before, but never had a camera handy to try to photograph one. I like your composition here. The focal point is at the center about a third up from the bottom; the brightest spot where the arc of the main rainbow leads my eye. The second rainbow to the right is positioned perfectly to balance the lightness to the left. The fence keeps the foreground from being completely boring, but doesn''t become a focal point itself. Well done.', '2003-08-22 13:53:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(396205, 34214, 9690, '<td valign="top">nice shot.  the bike is almost lost in the shadow, however</td>', 'nice shot.  the bike is almost lost in the shadow, however', '2003-08-22 13:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(396215, 33436, 10402, '<td valign="top">Great control over both shutter speed and DOF here. I like the designs made by the light reflection in the moving bat.</td>', 'Great control over both shutter speed and DOF here. I like the designs made by the light reflection in the moving bat.', '2003-08-22 14:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(396216, 34179, 9895, '<td valign="top">no real focus, needs a filet to get the real blue of the sky...</td>', 'no real focus, needs a filet to get the real blue of the sky...', '2003-08-22 14:04:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(396221, 34246, 4517, '<td valign="top">Very colourful. 6</td>', 'Very colourful. 6', '2003-08-22 14:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(396222, 33970, 10402, '<td valign="top">Good choice to leave the player out of focus, keeping the center of interest on the boy. I can certainly imagine what he must be dreaming!</td>', 'Good choice to leave the player out of focus, keeping the center of interest on the boy. I can certainly imagine what he must be dreaming!', '2003-08-22 14:10:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(396223, 33262, 4517, '<td valign="top">Nice scene. A touch more contrast and colour saturation would boost it a bit.</td>', 'Nice scene. A touch more contrast and colour saturation would boost it a bit.', '2003-08-22 14:10:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(396226, 33671, 4517, '<td valign="top">Is it not summer now in Holland?</td>', 'Is it not summer now in Holland?', '2003-08-22 14:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(396228, 34350, 9895, '<td valign="top">nice picture, secially the head popping out of the sea...is it lockness? ;)</td>', 'nice picture, secially the head popping out of the sea...is it lockness? ;)', '2003-08-22 14:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(396232, 33279, 10402, '<td valign="top">You made this photo at just the right time when the shadows are the perfect length. Much shorter and they wouldn''t be as dramatic; much longer and too many of them would obscure the slopes of other mountains.</td>', 'You made this photo at just the right time when the shadows are the perfect length. Much shorter and they wouldn''t be as dramatic; much longer and too many of them would obscure the slopes of other mountains.', '2003-08-22 14:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(396238, 33539, 9895, '<td valign="top">these hummingbirds are so quick, excellent timing</td>', 'these hummingbirds are so quick, excellent timing', '2003-08-22 14:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(396253, 34217, 10402, '<td valign="top">Nice symmetry here. The lines in the boats and the dock all lead the eye to the trees, whose beauty is enhanced by their gentle reflections in the water. The boats are not the center of interest here, but are certainly an essential part of the composition; calling attention to them with the title is a nice touch.</td>', 'Nice symmetry here. The lines in the boats and the dock all lead the eye to the trees, whose beauty is enhanced by their gentle reflections in the water. The boats are not the center of interest here, but are certainly an essential part of the composition; calling attention to them with the title is a nice touch.', '2003-08-22 14:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(396258, 33895, 11191, '<td valign="top">it''s nice. but way to dark. overall nice photo</td>', 'it''s nice. but way to dark. overall nice photo', '2003-08-22 14:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
