(396491, 34299, 10047, '<td valign="top">A little soft on the focus and too much shadow on the kids, I think. I might have tried cropping out most of the red reflection on the left upper side.</td>', 'A little soft on the focus and too much shadow on the kids, I think. I might have tried cropping out most of the red reflection on the left upper side.', '2003-08-22 17:30:57.000000', NULL, 1),
