(396571, 34140, 6888, '<td valign="top">composition is good, color is good, focus is right on, techinically a good photo and pleasing to the eye as well, good job</td>', 'composition is good, color is good, focus is right on, techinically a good photo and pleasing to the eye as well, good job', '2003-08-22 18:52:58.000000', NULL, 1),
