(396673, 33300, 2158, '<td valign="top">A bit of levels / contrast adjustment would make this a really nice picture.  As it is, I find it too pale and flat.</td>', 'A bit of levels / contrast adjustment would make this a really nice picture.  As it is, I find it too pale and flat.', '2003-08-22 20:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(396678, 33975, 9411, '<td valign="top">this is one of those, compelling but creepy shots! I love it.  Flash?</td>', 'this is one of those, compelling but creepy shots! I love it.  Flash?', '2003-08-22 20:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(396682, 34175, 9411, '<td valign="top">This one needs better focus.  Great colours. Could have been quite outstanding.</td>', 'This one needs better focus.  Great colours. Could have been quite outstanding.', '2003-08-22 20:35:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(396685, 34362, 9411, '<td valign="top">Very nice, the colour and building profiles make th shot.</td>', 'Very nice, the colour and building profiles make th shot.', '2003-08-22 20:36:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(396697, 33283, 11106, '<td valign="top">interesting interpretation</td>', 'interesting interpretation', '2003-08-22 20:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(396709, 34280, 10799, '<td valign="top">The greenery was distracting to me... the texture seemed out of place with the sunflower.   The sunflower is bright and clear and well done.</td>', 'The greenery was distracting to me... the texture seemed out of place with the sunflower.   The sunflower is bright and clear and well done.', '2003-08-22 21:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(396710, 34002, 10084, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition.  Focus is perfect. Tough getting a photo of hummingbird. They fly so fast. Great shot.</td>', 'Beautiful composition.  Focus is perfect. Tough getting a photo of hummingbird. They fly so fast. Great shot.', '2003-08-22 21:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(396713, 34102, 10084, '<td valign="top">Great focus and composition. Love the reflections of the head.</td>', 'Great focus and composition. Love the reflections of the head.', '2003-08-22 21:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(396714, 34382, 10799, '<td valign="top">It might be interesting to see this cropped so the bird is not right in the middle.    Great shot!</td>', 'It might be interesting to see this cropped so the bird is not right in the middle.    Great shot!', '2003-08-22 21:37:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(396715, 34363, 10084, '<td valign="top">The composition is great. Focusing is spot on. The reflections of the water droplets look nice. Beautiful</td>', 'The composition is great. Focusing is spot on. The reflections of the water droplets look nice. Beautiful', '2003-08-22 21:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(396716, 34175, 10799, '<td valign="top">The depth of field could be improved I think. I am not sure which area you want as your focal point.</td>', 'The depth of field could be improved I think. I am not sure which area you want as your focal point.', '2003-08-22 21:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(396718, 34389, 10084, '<td valign="top">Colorful shot. Nice composition. I like the tree trunk. I wish that it was move over toward the center a little more. The little space on the left is distracting. Depth of field is great.</td>', 'Colorful shot. Nice composition. I like the tree trunk. I wish that it was move over toward the center a little more. The little space on the left is distracting. Depth of field is great.', '2003-08-22 21:40:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(396719, 34241, 10799, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot but what season does this represent?  Maybe this is not the best photo for this challenge but it is a great shot to have!</td>', 'Wonderful shot but what season does this represent?  Maybe this is not the best photo for this challenge but it is a great shot to have!', '2003-08-22 21:41:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(396720, 34198, 10084, '<td valign="top">Composition is good. Great subject matter. Great summer scene.Polarising filter may give the water a deeper blue color which would give it a bigger punch.</td>', 'Composition is good. Great subject matter. Great summer scene.Polarising filter may give the water a deeper blue color which would give it a bigger punch.', '2003-08-22 21:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(396721, 33500, 10799, '<td valign="top">I wish I could figure out what the objects are in the middle ... as a naturally curious person I want to SEE them...Great sky and composititon.</td>', 'I wish I could figure out what the objects are in the middle ... as a naturally curious person I want to SEE them...Great sky and composititon.', '2003-08-22 21:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(396722, 34364, 10084, '<td valign="top">Great composition. Splashing of water adds too the picture. Beautiful colors. It doesn''t hurt to have a nice looking model.</td>', 'Great composition. Splashing of water adds too the picture. Beautiful colors. It doesn''t hurt to have a nice looking model.', '2003-08-22 21:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(396723, 33840, 10084, '<td valign="top">Composition is good. Love those water droplets. Very sharp picture. Maybe blur the background a tiny bit and the foreground should pop out even more.</td>', 'Composition is good. Love those water droplets. Very sharp picture. Maybe blur the background a tiny bit and the foreground should pop out even more.', '2003-08-22 21:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(396725, 34002, 10799, '<td valign="top">Excellent color and detail and composition.  Great work.</td>', 'Excellent color and detail and composition.  Great work.', '2003-08-22 21:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(396726, 34287, 10799, '<td valign="top">All the other foliage is too cluttered and takes away from the bird.</td>', 'All the other foliage is too cluttered and takes away from the bird.', '2003-08-22 21:53:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(396727, 34345, 10084, '<td valign="top">Good composition.  Nice details. Focus is great, gives it a great depth of field. Looks almost like a corndog. Yummy</td>', 'Good composition.  Nice details. Focus is great, gives it a great depth of field. Looks almost like a corndog. Yummy', '2003-08-22 21:54:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(396730, 34288, 10799, '<td valign="top">I think the flower is a bit small compared to the green around it.  Cropped a little tighter would give this the wow it needs.</td>', 'I think the flower is a bit small compared to the green around it.  Cropped a little tighter would give this the wow it needs.', '2003-08-22 21:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(396732, 34260, 10084, '<td valign="top">Great composition. Love the wheel lines. Blues of the sky looks great. Some specks of dust. Tree lines is a little bit dark.</td>', 'Great composition. Love the wheel lines. Blues of the sky looks great. Some specks of dust. Tree lines is a little bit dark.', '2003-08-22 21:57:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(396735, 34206, 10084, '<td valign="top">Bit of noise. Turning down ISO should help. Focus in on the glass of ice tea. It should give you an image with more impact.<br/></td>', 'Bit of noise. Turning down ISO should help. Focus in on the glass of ice tea. It should give you an image with more impact.', '2003-08-22 21:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(396743, 33780, 6624, '<td valign="top">inquisitve and comical</td>', 'inquisitve and comical', '2003-08-22 22:06:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(396744, 33837, 6624, '<td valign="top">I feel as if I have seen this shot many times</td>', 'I feel as if I have seen this shot many times', '2003-08-22 22:06:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(396747, 34217, 6624, '<td valign="top">the light is very interesting and the eye is drawn out over the water</td>', 'the light is very interesting and the eye is drawn out over the water', '2003-08-22 22:07:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(396748, 34270, 6624, '<td valign="top">drought for real - how fragile our water supply is</td>', 'drought for real - how fragile our water supply is', '2003-08-22 22:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(396761, 34344, 11379, '<td valign="top">very crisp, i like that.</td>', 'very crisp, i like that.', '2003-08-22 22:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(396764, 34202, 11379, '<td valign="top">very interesting composition, also i like how the flame maxs the wax glow</td>', 'very interesting composition, also i like how the flame maxs the wax glow', '2003-08-22 22:28:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(396767, 33462, 10402, '<td valign="top">No points for meeting the challenge with a non-season sense of spring, but I like your composition with the spring and its interesting shadow, and you''ve left enough space around it to keep it from being cramped. There is some sort of pixelation, but it doesn''t look like the oversampling or compression artifacts so common in digital photos, and I kind of like the effect it gives to this image. I think it makes the photo a lot more interesting than just a sharp spring on a polished granite surface. Was it intentional? It is a bit distracting, perhaps slightly overdone, but it''s hard to say. It looks great viewed a few feet back.</td>', 'No points for meeting the challenge with a non-season sense of spring, but I like your composition with the spring and its interesting shadow, and you''ve left enough space around it to keep it from being cramped. There is some sort of pixelation, but it doesn''t look like the oversampling or compression artifacts so common in digital photos, and I kind of like the effect it gives to this image. I think it makes the photo a lot more interesting than just a sharp spring on a polished granite surface. Was it intentional? It is a bit distracting, perhaps slightly overdone, but it''s hard to say. It looks great viewed a few feet back.', '2003-08-22 22:38:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(396769, 34250, 10402, '<td valign="top">Nice composition here. The white space above and below help the watermelon stand out and help emphasize its colors. It would be better if the entire subject was in focus and the shadows were eliminated (especially the ones in the corners).</td>', 'Nice composition here. The white space above and below help the watermelon stand out and help emphasize its colors. It would be better if the entire subject was in focus and the shadows were eliminated (especially the ones in the corners).', '2003-08-22 22:48:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(396770, 33283, 10402, '<td valign="top">No points for meeting the challenge with the non-season sense of fall, but this photo has a lot of impact. You''ve picked a nice subject for zoom-blur and executed it very well.</td>', 'No points for meeting the challenge with the non-season sense of fall, but this photo has a lot of impact. You''ve picked a nice subject for zoom-blur and executed it very well.', '2003-08-22 22:51:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(396771, 34266, 11111, '<td valign="top">Great expression caught! This screams summer to me... kid, water, fishy! He''s having a ball! Composition-wise I''d like to see less of that lil'' arrow to the right and more of that cute fish. I enjoyed your photo!</td>', 'Great expression caught! This screams summer to me... kid, water, fishy! He''s having a ball! Composition-wise I''d like to see less of that lil'' arrow to the right and more of that cute fish. I enjoyed your photo!', '2003-08-22 22:52:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(396773, 34202, 10628, '<td valign="top">What about symmetry?</td>', 'What about symmetry?', '2003-08-22 22:54:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(396774, 33602, 11111, '<td valign="top">Lots of detail and nice composition. Makes me thirsty for some reason!</td>', 'Lots of detail and nice composition. Makes me thirsty for some reason!', '2003-08-22 22:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(396775, 34347, 11111, '<td valign="top">Great action shot! You''ve really captured the moment!</td>', 'Great action shot! You''ve really captured the moment!', '2003-08-22 22:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(396776, 33894, 11111, '<td valign="top">I love the lighting on wheat. Nice, intense colors. Feels like summer to me!</td>', 'I love the lighting on wheat. Nice, intense colors. Feels like summer to me!', '2003-08-22 22:56:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(396778, 33299, 11111, '<td valign="top">Beautiful rich colors here, but the background feels a little muddled to me, maybe because it''s so colorful as well. I like your choice of subject though and you''ve done a nice job composing this. Hope this helps.</td>', 'Beautiful rich colors here, but the background feels a little muddled to me, maybe because it''s so colorful as well. I like your choice of subject though and you''ve done a nice job composing this. Hope this helps.', '2003-08-22 22:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(396779, 34002, 11111, '<td valign="top">Wow! You caught this little guy! This is so crisp and the colors are wonderful.</td>', 'Wow! You caught this little guy! This is so crisp and the colors are wonderful.', '2003-08-22 23:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(396780, 34185, 11111, '<td valign="top">The leaves frame the dove perfectly.</td>', 'The leaves frame the dove perfectly.', '2003-08-22 23:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(396782, 34389, 11111, '<td valign="top">Looks like a postcard. I''d definitely want to vacation here.</td>', 'Looks like a postcard. I''d definitely want to vacation here.', '2003-08-22 23:02:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(396784, 34293, 10402, '<td valign="top">While baseball is synonomous with summer (at least in the U.S.), the stadium exists year-round so this photo doesn''t represent summer as well as some of the other entries. But this photo is well done. The tree in the foreground adds a nice touch of color, and nicely frames the "Minute Maid Park" sign.</td>', 'While baseball is synonomous with summer (at least in the U.S.), the stadium exists year-round so this photo doesn''t represent summer as well as some of the other entries. But this photo is well done. The tree in the foreground adds a nice touch of color, and nicely frames the "Minute Maid Park" sign.', '2003-08-22 23:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(396796, 34185, 5822, '<td valign="top">A+ for effort...You must have gotten a lot of exercise just climbing up the tree to get this shot. I wish the bird didn''t get lost behind the leaves and branches. It also blends in with the grey color of the tree too much, so it''s really hard to see him/her.</td>', 'A+ for effort...You must have gotten a lot of exercise just climbing up the tree to get this shot. I wish the bird didn''t get lost behind the leaves and branches. It also blends in with the grey color of the tree too much, so it''s really hard to see him/her.', '2003-08-22 23:15:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(396797, 34314, 10402, '<td valign="top">The boy is nicely posed and perfectly focused, and you''ve captured a nice texture in the water. I like the title.</td>', 'The boy is nicely posed and perfectly focused, and you''ve captured a nice texture in the water. I like the title.', '2003-08-22 23:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
