(396836, 33648, 5822, '<td valign="top">I really love this shot! I love the different shades of blue  contrasting nicely with the dark tan sand.  And the glare off the water really create a wonderful moody picture.   The underexposure youi''ve chosen really works well here and the composition is very good as well.  Only thing is I think there is too much sky, but that''s just me...giving a high score.</td>', 'I really love this shot! I love the different shades of blue  contrasting nicely with the dark tan sand.  And the glare off the water really create a wonderful moody picture.   The underexposure youi''ve chosen really works well here and the composition is very good as well.  Only thing is I think there is too much sky, but that''s just me...giving a high score.', '2003-08-23 00:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
