(396856, 34202, 10402, '<td valign="top">Blackouts aren''t specific to a season, and candles aren''t always used for blackouts. But this is a beautiful candle photo. The colors are great, and I like the contrasting dark space to the right.</td>', 'Blackouts aren''t specific to a season, and candles aren''t always used for blackouts. But this is a beautiful candle photo. The colors are great, and I like the contrasting dark space to the right.', '2003-08-23 00:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
