(396865, 34272, 10402, '<td valign="top">This is technically well done (although some light details are a bit washed out). But it needs a center of interest, something to catch and hold the viewer''s attention.</td>', 'This is technically well done (although some light details are a bit washed out). But it needs a center of interest, something to catch and hold the viewer''s attention.', '2003-08-23 00:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(396874, 34224, 10402, '<td valign="top">True surfers don''t care what season it is, but this is a nice photo. The color reflecting in the water is great and the forming waves show up well. The silhouetted surfers seem to be enjoying the beauty before jumping in and your composition emphasizes the vastness of the ocean.</td>', 'True surfers don''t care what season it is, but this is a nice photo. The color reflecting in the water is great and the forming waves show up well. The silhouetted surfers seem to be enjoying the beauty before jumping in and your composition emphasizes the vastness of the ocean.', '2003-08-23 01:09:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(396886, 34315, 10799, '<td valign="top">People don''t use these in the spring or fall at outdoor events????  I think the photo is clear and crisp and has a great angle.</td>', 'People don''t use these in the spring or fall at outdoor events????  I think the photo is clear and crisp and has a great angle.', '2003-08-23 01:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(396901, 34246, 10402, '<td valign="top">Cute shot. Softer lighting (at sunset for example) would have been more "dreamy", but may not have conveyed "summer" as well. Tough choice, but the bright highlights on the rightmost toys are distracting. A lot of lines in the picture (including the direction of the girl''s face and the angle of the smaller toys) lead the viewer''s eye to Pooh, making him the center of interest, and he is looking out of the photo, emphasizing this. I''m not sure this is what was intended.</td>', 'Cute shot. Softer lighting (at sunset for example) would have been more "dreamy", but may not have conveyed "summer" as well. Tough choice, but the bright highlights on the rightmost toys are distracting. A lot of lines in the picture (including the direction of the girl''s face and the angle of the smaller toys) lead the viewer''s eye to Pooh, making him the center of interest, and he is looking out of the photo, emphasizing this. I''m not sure this is what was intended.', '2003-08-23 01:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(396914, 33838, 10402, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo. The motion blur and light color give the waterfall a soft dreamy look which is a nice contrast with the hard, dark, stable rocks. Most waterfalls flow in spring and autumn too, so this doesn''t strongly convey summer, but I still very much like this image.</td>', 'Beautiful photo. The motion blur and light color give the waterfall a soft dreamy look which is a nice contrast with the hard, dark, stable rocks. Most waterfalls flow in spring and autumn too, so this doesn''t strongly convey summer, but I still very much like this image.', '2003-08-23 01:57:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(396954, 34353, 9906, '<td valign="top">This is a great intrepretation of the theme.  I think the big square shadow is very distracting of the subject of the picture (I''m assuming to be the swimsuit).  A different time of day or a different angle would have done the trick!</td>', 'This is a great intrepretation of the theme.  I think the big square shadow is very distracting of the subject of the picture (I''m assuming to be the swimsuit).  A different time of day or a different angle would have done the trick!', '2003-08-23 02:45:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(396960, 34316, 9906, '<td valign="top">I still don''t get the going with a monotone image when trying to convey season.....This would be a  much stronger image with bright sunlit colors....Love the composition though!</td>', 'I still don''t get the going with a monotone image when trying to convey season.....This would be a  much stronger image with bright sunlit colors....Love the composition though!', '2003-08-23 03:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(396975, 34310, 9027, '<td valign="top">Hahhaha. Thanks for making me laugh. That dog looks thirsty. Good colors and nice use of aperture settings. Only comment is I feel the left side is a bit too tightly cropped and doesn''t balance the drink side.</td>', 'Hahhaha. Thanks for making me laugh. That dog looks thirsty. Good colors and nice use of aperture settings. Only comment is I feel the left side is a bit too tightly cropped and doesn''t balance the drink side.', '2003-08-23 03:42:02.000000', NULL, 1),
