(397110, 34002, 4288, '<td valign="top">I know it is very difficult to get a good shot of a hummingbird. I have found that it is best to preset the focus to the point where you expect the hummingbird to come, use a fast shutterspeed and flash, and wait for the little beauty to show up!</td>', 'I know it is very difficult to get a good shot of a hummingbird. I have found that it is best to preset the focus to the point where you expect the hummingbird to come, use a fast shutterspeed and flash, and wait for the little beauty to show up!', '2003-08-23 12:10:38.000000', NULL, 1),
