(397247, 33414, 6900, '<td valign="top">Ack!  Someone tilted the lake!  (Fix your horizon with a small rotation).<br/>It needs a bit of contrast as well.</td>', 'Ack!  Someone tilted the lake!  (Fix your horizon with a small rotation).It needs a bit of contrast as well.', '2003-08-23 14:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(397249, 33449, 6900, '<td valign="top">I live in Saratoga - Summer DEFINITELY means horse racing!  I am skipping the Travers to comment here, so let me make it good:<br/>The whole picture needs contrast.  The left side also needs more color and perhaps a center of attention.  The 6 horse is most prominent but his rider is gone. The other riders are barely seen.  I understand how hard it is to get horse pictures, having taken hundreds at the track this year, but I don''t think this is the best you could get.</td>', 'I live in Saratoga - Summer DEFINITELY means horse racing!  I am skipping the Travers to comment here, so let me make it good:The whole picture needs contrast.  The left side also needs more color and perhaps a center of attention.  The 6 horse is most prominent but his rider is gone. The other riders are barely seen.  I understand how hard it is to get horse pictures, having taken hundreds at the track this year, but I don''t think this is the best you could get.', '2003-08-23 14:31:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(397250, 34245, 6900, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure how to even comment on IR.  I think the tree looks overexposed, but what do I know?  I like the left and right side of this picture - in fact, if you took the right side by itself (everything left of the main tree) I think that makes a fabulous picture.  The center doesn''t add enough to it except for the one over-white tree.</td>', 'I''m not sure how to even comment on IR.  I think the tree looks overexposed, but what do I know?  I like the left and right side of this picture - in fact, if you took the right side by itself (everything left of the main tree) I think that makes a fabulous picture.  The center doesn''t add enough to it except for the one over-white tree.', '2003-08-23 14:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(397251, 34258, 6900, '<td valign="top">BRRRRRRR<br/> <br/>I''m NOT looking forward to winter, thanks!  :)</td>', 'BRRRRRRR I''m NOT looking forward to winter, thanks!  :)', '2003-08-23 14:33:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(397252, 33262, 6900, '<td valign="top">Needs more contrast - and perhaps a hue shift to turn your sky more blue.</td>', 'Needs more contrast - and perhaps a hue shift to turn your sky more blue.', '2003-08-23 14:34:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(397254, 34361, 6900, '<td valign="top">A good rule in photography - take 3 steps closer to the subject.  In this case, you wanted the dog, but I don''t think it adds anything.  I would have zoomed/moved closer to the kids because from here, you can''t see their faces  and the center of interest is the .. water?</td>', 'A good rule in photography - take 3 steps closer to the subject.  In this case, you wanted the dog, but I don''t think it adds anything.  I would have zoomed/moved closer to the kids because from here, you can''t see their faces  and the center of interest is the .. water?', '2003-08-23 14:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(397255, 34097, 6900, '<td valign="top">SUPER overexposed.  Lost too much detail here.</td>', 'SUPER overexposed.  Lost too much detail here.', '2003-08-23 14:35:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(397256, 34214, 6900, '<td valign="top">Your exposure needs work.  The tree is too dark (hiding the black bike seat) while the background is too bright (turning details white).  Not sure how I''d fix those problems, but they definitely are such.</td>', 'Your exposure needs work.  The tree is too dark (hiding the black bike seat) while the background is too bright (turning details white).  Not sure how I''d fix those problems, but they definitely are such.', '2003-08-23 14:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(397258, 33838, 6900, '<td valign="top">Sweet shot! I''d have cut 3 or 4 mm off the top of this bu the composition is pretty good, the water is beautiful (ND filter?) and the rocks add shape and interest.</td>', 'Sweet shot! I''d have cut 3 or 4 mm off the top of this bu the composition is pretty good, the water is beautiful (ND filter?) and the rocks add shape and interest.', '2003-08-23 14:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(397261, 34293, 6900, '<td valign="top">Needs a bit more contrast and sharpness.  Try a multipass sharpening - it''ll add contrast AND sharpen it at the same time.</td>', 'Needs a bit more contrast and sharpness.  Try a multipass sharpening - it''ll add contrast AND sharpen it at the same time.', '2003-08-23 14:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(397264, 33956, 6900, '<td valign="top">Excellent symmetry and colors. I like the subjects, just not sure how the banana relates to the film. lol</td>', 'Excellent symmetry and colors. I like the subjects, just not sure how the banana relates to the film. lol', '2003-08-23 14:45:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(397312, 33634, 2337, '<td valign="top">Great concept and it nails the challenge.  2 nitpicks though...<br/> <br/>1 ~ The horizon id severly sloped and I don''t feel it adds anything to the shot.<br/> <br/>2 ~ you could take a lot off both the left and right and lose nothing.  I feel that losing the left to the fence pole and losing the right to the volleyball net post (or even closer) would have left you with a much stronger image.<br/> <br/>But that''s just me.</td>', 'Great concept and it nails the challenge.  2 nitpicks though... 1 ~ The horizon id severly sloped and I don''t feel it adds anything to the shot. 2 ~ you could take a lot off both the left and right and lose nothing.  I feel that losing the left to the fence pole and losing the right to the volleyball net post (or even closer) would have left you with a much stronger image. But that''s just me.', '2003-08-23 16:05:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(397314, 34286, 9810, '<td valign="top">Would be so much better if the fork thingys were not blurred, I like the idea you had, and love the picture...except for those darn forks!</td>', 'Would be so much better if the fork thingys were not blurred, I like the idea you had, and love the picture...except for those darn forks!', '2003-08-23 16:07:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(397315, 34132, 9810, '<td valign="top">I like the way the picture is off centered and I also like the buds in back of the flower, good shot.</td>', 'I like the way the picture is off centered and I also like the buds in back of the flower, good shot.', '2003-08-23 16:08:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(397316, 34046, 9810, '<td valign="top">Awesome picture, it almost looks like fire!</td>', 'Awesome picture, it almost looks like fire!', '2003-08-23 16:09:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(397317, 33436, 9810, '<td valign="top">Too bad you didnt get the bat and ball so they wernt blurred, I think it would have made it alot better.</td>', 'Too bad you didnt get the bat and ball so they wernt blurred, I think it would have made it alot better.', '2003-08-23 16:10:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(397320, 34392, 2337, '<td valign="top">I''m undecided if the stone wall at the bottom adds anything here.  I think if you crop just above it you have an <i>extremely</i> powerful image...   But that''s just me :)</td>', 'I''m undecided if the stone wall at the bottom adds anything here.  I think if you crop just above it you have an extremely powerful image...   But that''s just me :)', '2003-08-23 16:10:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(397324, 34324, 9810, '<td valign="top">Cute picture, The grass looks more in focus than the squirrl.</td>', 'Cute picture, The grass looks more in focus than the squirrl.', '2003-08-23 16:12:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(397328, 34315, 9810, '<td valign="top">Wow, thats alot of port-o-lets. I like it.</td>', 'Wow, thats alot of port-o-lets. I like it.', '2003-08-23 16:13:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(397333, 33394, 9810, '<td valign="top">I like the way the sun shines thru the upper part of the flower and not the lower, that bright green leaf in the left part of the photo really takes some of the attetion off of the sunflower, overall a nice shot.</td>', 'I like the way the sun shines thru the upper part of the flower and not the lower, that bright green leaf in the left part of the photo really takes some of the attetion off of the sunflower, overall a nice shot.', '2003-08-23 16:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(397335, 33324, 9810, '<td valign="top">Too bad you couldnt get the suns reflection more in the pond, I think it would have made it better.</td>', 'Too bad you couldnt get the suns reflection more in the pond, I think it would have made it better.', '2003-08-23 16:16:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(397336, 34304, 9810, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, however the left part of the flower looks out of focus.</td>', 'Nice colors, however the left part of the flower looks out of focus.', '2003-08-23 16:16:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(397337, 34268, 10883, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, at first sight it seems cluttered, but when I take a closer look at it I find the composition to be quite interesting and it´s a nice touch how the boat is ,,framed" within the picture. - 8</td>', 'Nice shot, at first sight it seems cluttered, but when I take a closer look at it I find the composition to be quite interesting and it´s a nice touch how the boat is ,,framed" within the picture. - 8', '2003-08-23 16:19:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(397339, 33322, 9810, '<td valign="top">Nice picture of a wren? (2 out of 3 family birdwatchers agree, the other one isnt here). It looks alittle unshapr though.</td>', 'Nice picture of a wren? (2 out of 3 family birdwatchers agree, the other one isnt here). It looks alittle unshapr though.', '2003-08-23 16:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(397342, 34305, 9810, '<td valign="top">Sigh, I wont tell you what all the others are gonna say.(They did it to me too!)</td>', 'Sigh, I wont tell you what all the others are gonna say.(They did it to me too!)', '2003-08-23 16:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(397343, 33970, 9810, '<td valign="top">You should have gotten a picture with sheffield in the background *that* would have been cool.</td>', 'You should have gotten a picture with sheffield in the background *that* would have been cool.', '2003-08-23 16:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(397345, 34254, 7703, '<td valign="top">To small picture</td>', 'To small picture', '2003-08-23 16:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(397419, 34256, 10402, '<td valign="top">You caught the perfect pose here, and left just the right amount of motion blur. While a tighter cropping would work here (and be more conventional), your composition gives some context which makes the photo more attractive.</td>', 'You caught the perfect pose here, and left just the right amount of motion blur. While a tighter cropping would work here (and be more conventional), your composition gives some context which makes the photo more attractive.', '2003-08-23 17:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(397424, 33285, 10402, '<td valign="top">The low key lightning, selective focus, and interesting shape make this a very dramatic image. I didn''t know a dead leaf could be so interesting!</td>', 'The low key lightning, selective focus, and interesting shape make this a very dramatic image. I didn''t know a dead leaf could be so interesting!', '2003-08-23 17:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
