(397440, 34283, 10799, '<td valign="top">Too many things are competing for attention in this photo.  The fence in the foreground , the wagon, and the fence on the side are all noteworthy of themselves but together this way they each seem to have equal weighting and compete for the focal point of the photo.</td>', 'Too many things are competing for attention in this photo.  The fence in the foreground , the wagon, and the fence on the side are all noteworthy of themselves but together this way they each seem to have equal weighting and compete for the focal point of the photo.', '2003-08-23 18:46:38.000000', NULL, 1),
