(398174, 33878, 10768, '<td valign="top">Wow.  What a crisp shot.  Very vibrant colors.  Good DOF.  It makes you feel like you are right in the picture it is so clear.  Well done.</td>', 'Wow.  What a crisp shot.  Very vibrant colors.  Good DOF.  It makes you feel like you are right in the picture it is so clear.  Well done.', '2003-08-24 23:52:14.000000', NULL, 1),
