(398217, 33897, 5822, '<td valign="top">Even with the blown out sky, I love this photo.  The lighting is almost surreal and the image speaks volumes to me about recless abandon and youth.  You can almost feel the heat coming off the water in the form of mist in the background.  I like the composition and the way you''ve captured the boy in mid air. Very well done.</td>', 'Even with the blown out sky, I love this photo.  The lighting is almost surreal and the image speaks volumes to me about recless abandon and youth.  You can almost feel the heat coming off the water in the form of mist in the background.  I like the composition and the way you''ve captured the boy in mid air. Very well done.', '2003-08-25 00:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
