(399351, 34175, 8911, '<td valign="top">I like your subject, but the focus appears to have settled on the front left - which is over-bright and therefore doesn''t look quite in focus even though I think it''s the closest to in focus of any of them. I''m not quite sure where to rest my eyes.</td>', 'I like your subject, but the focus appears to have settled on the front left - which is over-bright and therefore doesn''t look quite in focus even though I think it''s the closest to in focus of any of them. I''m not quite sure where to rest my eyes.', '2003-08-26 00:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(399354, 34104, 8911, '<td valign="top">Cool mural - how does it say summer? Is there something special about it that it would only have been around then? I wonder if a slightly darker image would have helped - the sky is glaring bright - but the focus on your subject is good and I''m not entirely sure it could have stood to be darkened.</td>', 'Cool mural - how does it say summer? Is there something special about it that it would only have been around then? I wonder if a slightly darker image would have helped - the sky is glaring bright - but the focus on your subject is good and I''m not entirely sure it could have stood to be darkened.', '2003-08-26 00:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(399355, 34113, 8911, '<td valign="top">This is a really cool photograph, very evocative, good mood. I think the constrast of the bright lights against the dimmer trees has done it a disservice, though - areas are washed-out where others are just barely light enough. Maybe a different angle or location, so the brilliance of the restaurant (?) on the left would be more contained? Just guessing. It''s a lovely scene - makes me want to step into it.</td>', 'This is a really cool photograph, very evocative, good mood. I think the constrast of the bright lights against the dimmer trees has done it a disservice, though - areas are washed-out where others are just barely light enough. Maybe a different angle or location, so the brilliance of the restaurant (?) on the left would be more contained? Just guessing. It''s a lovely scene - makes me want to step into it.', '2003-08-26 00:45:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(399357, 34384, 8911, '<td valign="top">A very summer scene, and very cool. Was the look of an older photo deliberate? It''s really nice. I do wish there''d been a slightly crisper focus, probably on the lifeguard stand, though - I''m not sure if it''s so soft/blurred because of focus or because of the sky behind it.</td>', 'A very summer scene, and very cool. Was the look of an older photo deliberate? It''s really nice. I do wish there''d been a slightly crisper focus, probably on the lifeguard stand, though - I''m not sure if it''s so soft/blurred because of focus or because of the sky behind it.', '2003-08-26 00:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(399359, 33653, 8911, '<td valign="top">I like this - the beauty of the town in the background, soft and out of focus, and the crisp clear realities of work that speak so to the season. :)</td>', 'I like this - the beauty of the town in the background, soft and out of focus, and the crisp clear realities of work that speak so to the season. :)', '2003-08-26 00:49:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(399360, 34341, 8911, '<td valign="top">The warm colors make me think summer, the trees'' shapes make me think winter, and in any case this is definitely evocative. I like your choice of framing, to use the reflection rather than take the shot straight on. Beautiful colors and lines. The car right behind you is mildly distracting, but I only noticed it on my second or third study of the image.</td>', 'The warm colors make me think summer, the trees'' shapes make me think winter, and in any case this is definitely evocative. I like your choice of framing, to use the reflection rather than take the shot straight on. Beautiful colors and lines. The car right behind you is mildly distracting, but I only noticed it on my second or third study of the image.', '2003-08-26 00:51:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(399361, 33841, 8911, '<td valign="top">I love this photo. The colors are so rich - the composition just so - the shadow amidst the sky-reflections on the driveway. This has that "wow" effect, for me.</td>', 'I love this photo. The colors are so rich - the composition just so - the shadow amidst the sky-reflections on the driveway. This has that "wow" effect, for me.', '2003-08-26 00:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(399362, 33598, 8911, '<td valign="top">Very pretty - I like the effect of the reflections and the mist, taken together, especially.</td>', 'Very pretty - I like the effect of the reflections and the mist, taken together, especially.', '2003-08-26 00:55:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(399363, 33780, 8911, '<td valign="top">This guy is a little charmer, isn''t he? Lovely depth of focus and a nice tight closeup. Very seasonal, even if your main subject isn''t himself. I really like this photo!</td>', 'This guy is a little charmer, isn''t he? Lovely depth of focus and a nice tight closeup. Very seasonal, even if your main subject isn''t himself. I really like this photo!', '2003-08-26 00:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(399381, 34260, 11347, '<td valign="top">Interesting clouds. Wish the trees were more visible. And Its missing a crop circle! Very nice shot.</td>', 'Interesting clouds. Wish the trees were more visible. And Its missing a crop circle! Very nice shot.', '2003-08-26 01:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(399382, 34265, 11347, '<td valign="top">Simple. I love it.</td>', 'Simple. I love it.', '2003-08-26 01:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(399383, 33841, 11347, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites from this challenge. Rich colors, nice perspective. Very Nice. -9</td>', 'One of my favorites from this challenge. Rich colors, nice perspective. Very Nice. -9', '2003-08-26 01:27:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(399425, 34332, 7106, '<td valign="top">They don''t look to happy that your taking their picture. Maybe its just been a long ride ;)</td>', 'They don''t look to happy that your taking their picture. Maybe its just been a long ride ;)', '2003-08-26 02:25:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(399447, 33300, 4008, '<td valign="top">overexposed</td>', 'overexposed', '2003-08-26 03:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(399448, 34306, 4008, '<td valign="top">sharpness should have been at the larger front pebbels with some less blocking of view by the sand in front</td>', 'sharpness should have been at the larger front pebbels with some less blocking of view by the sand in front', '2003-08-26 03:21:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(399451, 34128, 4008, '<td valign="top">An extremely overexposed IR image, and you did not block the IR transmitters of your camera, you can see the two light blobs at the top (Sony F7x7 ?)</td>', 'An extremely overexposed IR image, and you did not block the IR transmitters of your camera, you can see the two light blobs at the top (Sony F7x7 ?)', '2003-08-26 03:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(399452, 33726, 4008, '<td valign="top">great sharpness and I love the subtle color.</td>', 'great sharpness and I love the subtle color.', '2003-08-26 03:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(399460, 33725, 9602, '<td valign="top">Looks kinda over sharpened</td>', 'Looks kinda over sharpened', '2003-08-26 04:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(399461, 33786, 4258, '<td valign="top">Would have been a lovely macro if the wing nearer to the camera would have been in focus as well</td>', 'Would have been a lovely macro if the wing nearer to the camera would have been in focus as well', '2003-08-26 04:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(399462, 33584, 2567, '<td valign="top">Color, composition, DOF good.  Great shot.  Good luck.</td>', 'Color, composition, DOF good.  Great shot.  Good luck.', '2003-08-26 04:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(399463, 34301, 2567, '<td valign="top">Colors, composition, DOF good.  The way the clouds look like they are being swept away from the mountain is an added bonus IMO.  Nice shot.  Good luck.</td>', 'Colors, composition, DOF good.  The way the clouds look like they are being swept away from the mountain is an added bonus IMO.  Nice shot.  Good luck.', '2003-08-26 04:22:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(399464, 34358, 2567, '<td valign="top">Colors, composition and DOF good.  This is such a peaceful looking shot.  One of my favorites this challenge.  Good luck.</td>', 'Colors, composition and DOF good.  This is such a peaceful looking shot.  One of my favorites this challenge.  Good luck.', '2003-08-26 04:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(399466, 33379, 2567, '<td valign="top">Colors, composition, DOF good.  I like the rocks in front giving some depth to the water.  Nice shot.  Good luck.</td>', 'Colors, composition, DOF good.  I like the rocks in front giving some depth to the water.  Nice shot.  Good luck.', '2003-08-26 04:25:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(399468, 34046, 2567, '<td valign="top">Good coloring.  I like the land mass on the right and the wave across the whole shot.  Nice one.  Good luck.</td>', 'Good coloring.  I like the land mass on the right and the wave across the whole shot.  Nice one.  Good luck.', '2003-08-26 04:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(399471, 34362, 2567, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic shot.  Meets the challenge.  Is interesting and I like the coloring.  Nice shot.  Good luck.</td>', 'Very dramatic shot.  Meets the challenge.  Is interesting and I like the coloring.  Nice shot.  Good luck.', '2003-08-26 04:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(399472, 33397, 2567, '<td valign="top">This is a very peaceful shot.  I like the angles.  Nice coloring and composition.  Good luck.</td>', 'This is a very peaceful shot.  I like the angles.  Nice coloring and composition.  Good luck.', '2003-08-26 04:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(399474, 34333, 2567, '<td valign="top">Colors, DOF, composition good.  The drops from the cup is an added bonus.  Interesting subject that meets the challenge.  The only thing that detracts from this shot is the blurred orange object to the right of the spout.  Not sure what it is but wish it wasn''t there.  However that''s nit picking.  Great shot.  Good luck.</td>', 'Colors, DOF, composition good.  The drops from the cup is an added bonus.  Interesting subject that meets the challenge.  The only thing that detracts from this shot is the blurred orange object to the right of the spout.  Not sure what it is but wish it wasn''t there.  However that''s nit picking.  Great shot.  Good luck.', '2003-08-26 04:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(399476, 33602, 2567, '<td valign="top">This looks like it belongs on the cover of a National Geographic magazine.  Colors and composition good.  The trail in front leads the eye to the people that you would not necessarily notice otherwise.  Nice shot .  Good luck.</td>', 'This looks like it belongs on the cover of a National Geographic magazine.  Colors and composition good.  The trail in front leads the eye to the people that you would not necessarily notice otherwise.  Nice shot .  Good luck.', '2003-08-26 04:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(399477, 34260, 2567, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and colors.  Good luck.</td>', 'Nice composition and colors.  Good luck.', '2003-08-26 04:37:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(399479, 33540, 2567, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and composition.  Interesting subject that meets the challenge.  Good luck.</td>', 'I like the colors and composition.  Interesting subject that meets the challenge.  Good luck.', '2003-08-26 04:41:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(399480, 34037, 2567, '<td valign="top">Nice shot for B&amp;W.  Good composition and DOF.  Good luck.</td>', 'Nice shot for B&W.  Good composition and DOF.  Good luck.', '2003-08-26 04:45:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(399481, 33446, 2567, '<td valign="top">The humor in this is so refreshing.  Nice colors, composition and DOF.  Good luck.</td>', 'The humor in this is so refreshing.  Nice colors, composition and DOF.  Good luck.', '2003-08-26 04:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(399486, 34179, 11357, '<td valign="top">Great shot.</td>', 'Great shot.', '2003-08-26 04:57:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(399487, 34046, 11357, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.</td>', 'Beautiful.', '2003-08-26 05:00:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(399488, 33780, 11357, '<td valign="top">Adorable.</td>', 'Adorable.', '2003-08-26 05:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(399489, 34046, 10470, '<td valign="top">These colours are amazing !!!</td>', 'These colours are amazing !!!', '2003-08-26 05:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(399492, 33610, 11357, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot.</td>', 'Wonderful shot.', '2003-08-26 05:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(399493, 33671, 11357, '<td valign="top">Lovely</td>', 'Lovely', '2003-08-26 05:22:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(399495, 34265, 7690, '<td valign="top">Summertime HOT! This is great. Would have also been good for the Desolation challenge. 10</td>', 'Summertime HOT! This is great. Would have also been good for the Desolation challenge. 10', '2003-08-26 05:29:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(399497, 33999, 7690, '<td valign="top">Great interpretation of theme. Black and white is perfect. 10</td>', 'Great interpretation of theme. Black and white is perfect. 10', '2003-08-26 05:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(399498, 34268, 7690, '<td valign="top">This is very nice. The flowers, trees, green grass, blue sky all frame the boat racing across the water. All portray summer perfectly to me. Also very nicely balanced. 10</td>', 'This is very nice. The flowers, trees, green grass, blue sky all frame the boat racing across the water. All portray summer perfectly to me. Also very nicely balanced. 10', '2003-08-26 05:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(399500, 34258, 7690, '<td valign="top">Great photo, wish I was there right now. 10</td>', 'Great photo, wish I was there right now. 10', '2003-08-26 05:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(399502, 33322, 4258, '<td valign="top">A bit of noise reduction will make this even better</td>', 'A bit of noise reduction will make this even better', '2003-08-26 05:38:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(399503, 34102, 7690, '<td valign="top">WOW! Got to give you a 10 for this one. WOW</td>', 'WOW! Got to give you a 10 for this one. WOW', '2003-08-26 05:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(399504, 34270, 7690, '<td valign="top">This is great!  I am thirsty just looking at it. 10</td>', 'This is great!  I am thirsty just looking at it. 10', '2003-08-26 05:39:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(399505, 33539, 7690, '<td valign="top">Love it! Great catch! 10</td>', 'Love it! Great catch! 10', '2003-08-26 05:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(399507, 34338, 7690, '<td valign="top">where are the hot dogs and burgers? Or the S''mores?</td>', 'where are the hot dogs and burgers? Or the S''mores?', '2003-08-26 05:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(399508, 34177, 7690, '<td valign="top">This is very nice but I would love to have seen it in color. Although my imagination is picturing it in many different hues.</td>', 'This is very nice but I would love to have seen it in color. Although my imagination is picturing it in many different hues.', '2003-08-26 05:43:01.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(399510, 33582, 7690, '<td valign="top">wow, is that a june bug? I like this very much. 10</td>', 'wow, is that a june bug? I like this very much. 10', '2003-08-26 05:44:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(399512, 34387, 7690, '<td valign="top">I can just feel that heat and how cold the water must feel to those people. I love the coloring in this.</td>', 'I can just feel that heat and how cold the water must feel to those people. I love the coloring in this.', '2003-08-26 05:47:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(399513, 33671, 7690, '<td valign="top">I like this alot. 10</td>', 'I like this alot. 10', '2003-08-26 05:48:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(399514, 34372, 7690, '<td valign="top">mmmmm can taste that steak right now, right off the grill. Nice play on the topic.<br/>Would have liked to see the entire bottle.</td>', 'mmmmm can taste that steak right now, right off the grill. Nice play on the topic.Would have liked to see the entire bottle.', '2003-08-26 05:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(399516, 34330, 7690, '<td valign="top">absolutely lovely...this says it all. 10</td>', 'absolutely lovely...this says it all. 10', '2003-08-26 05:51:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(399517, 33931, 7690, '<td valign="top">can''t you just smell that rain? Very nice 10</td>', 'can''t you just smell that rain? Very nice 10', '2003-08-26 05:52:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(399519, 34134, 7690, '<td valign="top">very nice  10</td>', 'very nice  10', '2003-08-26 05:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(399520, 34128, 7690, '<td valign="top">wow, very interesting.</td>', 'wow, very interesting.', '2003-08-26 05:55:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(399521, 33874, 7690, '<td valign="top">very nice  10</td>', 'very nice  10', '2003-08-26 05:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(399523, 33838, 7690, '<td valign="top">beautiful! I can feel the misty spray on my face.  10</td>', 'beautiful! I can feel the misty spray on my face.  10', '2003-08-26 05:57:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(399536, 34265, 1143, '<td valign="top">I really like the colors and intersecting lines. Good focus. Not completely sure why I find this so appealing honestly. 10</td>', 'I really like the colors and intersecting lines. Good focus. Not completely sure why I find this so appealing honestly. 10', '2003-08-26 06:29:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(399537, 34224, 1143, '<td valign="top">very nice silhouette shot. definitely fits the challenge. their outlines seem a bit soft and it would be good if you could get the shadows to be blacker. 9</td>', 'very nice silhouette shot. definitely fits the challenge. their outlines seem a bit soft and it would be good if you could get the shadows to be blacker. 9', '2003-08-26 06:30:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(399538, 34330, 1143, '<td valign="top">love the lighting. very nice use of dof. beautiful color. 9</td>', 'love the lighting. very nice use of dof. beautiful color. 9', '2003-08-26 06:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(399539, 33393, 1143, '<td valign="top">this is just a very cool shot. very photojournalistic. reminds me of the old man and the sea. that guy in the center seems a little too dark maybe though. 9</td>', 'this is just a very cool shot. very photojournalistic. reminds me of the old man and the sea. that guy in the center seems a little too dark maybe though. 9', '2003-08-26 06:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(399541, 34260, 1143, '<td valign="top">i like the layers in this. beautiful sky and color. reminds me of my submission actually so it must be good  :)  the tree line is a little too dark or underexposed maybe. tough lighting situation. 8</td>', 'i like the layers in this. beautiful sky and color. reminds me of my submission actually so it must be good  :)  the tree line is a little too dark or underexposed maybe. tough lighting situation. 8', '2003-08-26 06:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(399542, 33930, 1143, '<td valign="top">lovely use of dof. nice composition. great color. excellent lighting. 8</td>', 'lovely use of dof. nice composition. great color. excellent lighting. 8', '2003-08-26 06:33:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(399543, 33816, 1143, '<td valign="top">summertime and the sky is hazy... or atleast it seems to be here which is a shame. the lines arent as crisp and the colors as clear as it could be. i like the reflection on the water but having the sun smack in the middle bugs me a tad. 8</td>', 'summertime and the sky is hazy... or atleast it seems to be here which is a shame. the lines arent as crisp and the colors as clear as it could be. i like the reflection on the water but having the sun smack in the middle bugs me a tad. 8', '2003-08-26 06:34:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(399545, 34358, 1143, '<td valign="top">Hey! beautiful sky. the composition seems a little off because of the way the pier goes all the way across the frame, dissecting it. it is still a really cool picture though. nice one. 8</td>', 'Hey! beautiful sky. the composition seems a little off because of the way the pier goes all the way across the frame, dissecting it. it is still a really cool picture though. nice one. 8', '2003-08-26 06:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(399546, 33824, 1143, '<td valign="top">what a great shot! excellent capture. good use of dof and so close! not the best representation of a season IMO, but the pic is just so good. 8</td>', 'what a great shot! excellent capture. good use of dof and so close! not the best representation of a season IMO, but the pic is just so good. 8', '2003-08-26 06:36:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(399548, 33838, 1143, '<td valign="top">spring, summer, or fall? gotta love them all when it is this pretty. isnt it a shame we cant really see waterfalls sped up like this? i just love the effect. the composition seems a tad squished. maybe you could leave some room on top or bottom. nice exposure. 7<br/></td>', 'spring, summer, or fall? gotta love them all when it is this pretty. isnt it a shame we cant really see waterfalls sped up like this? i just love the effect. the composition seems a tad squished. maybe you could leave some room on top or bottom. nice exposure. 7', '2003-08-26 06:37:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(399550, 33397, 1143, '<td valign="top">very serene, calming shot. i like how the lines come together. good color. the horizon is very centered, but not too distracting. 7</td>', 'very serene, calming shot. i like how the lines come together. good color. the horizon is very centered, but not too distracting. 7', '2003-08-26 06:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(399551, 34359, 1143, '<td valign="top">i really love what you were doing here. the light is just a little too close to the boy and they both are very centered. otherwise, it is a very good shot. excellent for the challenge too. 7</td>', 'i really love what you were doing here. the light is just a little too close to the boy and they both are very centered. otherwise, it is a very good shot. excellent for the challenge too. 7', '2003-08-26 06:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(399552, 34301, 1143, '<td valign="top">excellent color. amazing light on the cliffs! focus seems a bit soft maybe 7</td>', 'excellent color. amazing light on the cliffs! focus seems a bit soft maybe 7', '2003-08-26 06:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(399556, 34364, 1143, '<td valign="top">yup, this fits the challenge. a sky with fewer white clouds would maybe work better behind her head. there''s also a hot spot on her forehead. it is still very nice though. 7</td>', 'yup, this fits the challenge. a sky with fewer white clouds would maybe work better behind her head. there''s also a hot spot on her forehead. it is still very nice though. 7', '2003-08-26 06:43:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(399558, 34314, 1143, '<td valign="top">what a nice moment captured. good exposure. fits the challenge well. not extremely interesting in that it is a very calming shot (vs a wow shot) but not "pretty" in the traditional sense. technically very good though. 6</td>', 'what a nice moment captured. good exposure. fits the challenge well. not extremely interesting in that it is a very calming shot (vs a wow shot) but not "pretty" in the traditional sense. technically very good though. 6', '2003-08-26 06:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(399559, 33653, 1143, '<td valign="top">need to leave a bit more room on the right. pretty decent dof and exposure though. nice view in the background. you just need a little boy blue asleep next to it. 6</td>', 'need to leave a bit more room on the right. pretty decent dof and exposure though. nice view in the background. you just need a little boy blue asleep next to it. 6', '2003-08-26 06:45:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(399560, 34046, 1143, '<td valign="top">very beautiful. i have to bump this one up. love the color. what a great shot to hang in a beach house (if only i had one). not the best representation of a season though... the beach is empty so is this winter? it could also be any other season if you find the right spot. anyway, i love that sky. 7</td>', 'very beautiful. i have to bump this one up. love the color. what a great shot to hang in a beach house (if only i had one). not the best representation of a season though... the beach is empty so is this winter? it could also be any other season if you find the right spot. anyway, i love that sky. 7', '2003-08-26 06:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(399561, 33372, 1143, '<td valign="top">what IS that thing in the middle? you need a focal point and that is it so it should be more recognizable. very nice colors and lines though. reminds me of a postcard for the netherlands. 6</td>', 'what IS that thing in the middle? you need a focal point and that is it so it should be more recognizable. very nice colors and lines though. reminds me of a postcard for the netherlands. 6', '2003-08-26 06:46:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(399562, 34384, 1143, '<td valign="top">does that mean that it is winter or just a stormy day with no visitors? either way, it is an interesting picture. might leave a bit more room on the left. i also think it would work in color. focus is also a tad soft. 6</td>', 'does that mean that it is winter or just a stormy day with no visitors? either way, it is an interesting picture. might leave a bit more room on the left. i also think it would work in color. focus is also a tad soft. 6', '2003-08-26 06:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(399563, 34288, 1143, '<td valign="top">nice color combination. dof is almost too narrow. i would like to see a bit more of the flower (the stem maybe) in focus. nice exposure. 6</td>', 'nice color combination. dof is almost too narrow. i would like to see a bit more of the flower (the stem maybe) in focus. nice exposure. 6', '2003-08-26 06:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(399564, 34363, 1143, '<td valign="top">we get rain in all the seasons where i live. i like the dof and lines of this pic though. good exposure too. 6</td>', 'we get rain in all the seasons where i live. i like the dof and lines of this pic though. good exposure too. 6', '2003-08-26 06:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(399565, 33813, 1143, '<td valign="top">need a bit more light or exposure on the rock as the eye isnt drawn to it readily enough. maybe the leaf could be more colorful and obvious. also would help to cut down on the glare. i still like the feel of this picture. 6</td>', 'need a bit more light or exposure on the rock as the eye isnt drawn to it readily enough. maybe the leaf could be more colorful and obvious. also would help to cut down on the glare. i still like the feel of this picture. 6', '2003-08-26 06:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
