(400058, 34005, 4008, '<td valign="top">overexposed (loss of detail in floor and dog), unsharp (bot dog movement, but also surroundings), poor composition (a shot closer to the dog from the left of your current standpoint would have been better, right part of current image does not add anything, just distracts). Think about what you want to show : it is the fun the dog has, right ? So get closer, show the dog. And why is the dog still on the leash ?</td>', 'overexposed (loss of detail in floor and dog), unsharp (bot dog movement, but also surroundings), poor composition (a shot closer to the dog from the left of your current standpoint would have been better, right part of current image does not add anything, just distracts). Think about what you want to show : it is the fun the dog has, right ? So get closer, show the dog. And why is the dog still on the leash ?', '2003-08-26 17:30:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(400061, 34323, 9116, '<td valign="top">there are a lot of good photo''s in this series.  This one has the right color tones, lighting, depth, saturation and composition... simple yet apart.</td>', 'there are a lot of good photo''s in this series.  This one has the right color tones, lighting, depth, saturation and composition... simple yet apart.', '2003-08-26 17:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(400075, 34180, 6624, '<td valign="top">this is charmingly summery</td>', 'this is charmingly summery', '2003-08-26 17:57:40.000000', NULL, 1),
