(400152, 34287, 3955, '<td valign="top">nice shot!  I wonder if it would be better if you cropped a little more out.  the branches and leaves in the left and upper part of the photo are in perfect focus, but the bird is not (understandably).  anyway, i find it a bit distracting from the subject. i give you a 6</td>', 'nice shot!  I wonder if it would be better if you cropped a little more out.  the branches and leaves in the left and upper part of the photo are in perfect focus, but the bird is not (understandably).  anyway, i find it a bit distracting from the subject. i give you a 6', '2003-08-26 19:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(400155, 33378, 3955, '<td valign="top">i think you need to find a way to take that picture so her face is not in shadow, perhaps toying with the EV settings?  i give you a 5</td>', 'i think you need to find a way to take that picture so her face is not in shadow, perhaps toying with the EV settings?  i give you a 5', '2003-08-26 19:25:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(400156, 34280, 133, '<td valign="top">Very nice!</td>', 'Very nice!', '2003-08-26 19:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(400158, 34268, 3955, '<td valign="top">i like the way you framed the boat.  I would like to see how it would look if you cropped just a little more.  imo, i think you would have a better picture, but i am not sure without seeing it...  nice color too.  i give you an 8</td>', 'i like the way you framed the boat.  I would like to see how it would look if you cropped just a little more.  imo, i think you would have a better picture, but i am not sure without seeing it...  nice color too.  i give you an 8', '2003-08-26 19:27:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(400160, 34317, 133, '<td valign="top">Great lighting on this shot!</td>', 'Great lighting on this shot!', '2003-08-26 19:29:37.000000', NULL, 1),
