(400164, 33710, 3955, '<td valign="top">this picture has pretty good balance and interesting composition (bias here, i love water, and a bit of rapids is even better!).  I think you could have cropped it a little better, I would love to see a veritcally oriented version with about an 1/8th cropped on the left and a quarter cropped on the right.  I won''t hold that against you in your score, because I could be wrong (would have to see), just giving you an idea.  I give you a 7</td>', 'this picture has pretty good balance and interesting composition (bias here, i love water, and a bit of rapids is even better!).  I think you could have cropped it a little better, I would love to see a veritcally oriented version with about an 1/8th cropped on the left and a quarter cropped on the right.  I won''t hold that against you in your score, because I could be wrong (would have to see), just giving you an idea.  I give you a 7', '2003-08-26 19:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(400167, 34278, 133, '<td valign="top">Unusual cropping, but I like it.  It leaves a lot to your imagination.</td>', 'Unusual cropping, but I like it.  It leaves a lot to your imagination.', '2003-08-26 19:34:47.000000', NULL, 1),
