(400410, 34041, 6900, '<td valign="top">I''m commenting because you received zero comments!<br/> <br/>First of all, I gave you a 4.  I think there''s something wrong with the focus and I don''t think this represents any one season to me.  It is, however, a decent looking subject and there are nice colors.  Maybe something as a subject in this nice landscape would have made it stand out? <br/> <br/>Happy shooting,<br/>Mav</td>', 'I''m commenting because you received zero comments! First of all, I gave you a 4.  I think there''s something wrong with the focus and I don''t think this represents any one season to me.  It is, however, a decent looking subject and there are nice colors.  Maybe something as a subject in this nice landscape would have made it stand out?  Happy shooting,Mav', '2003-08-27 01:15:38.000000', NULL, 0),
