(400612, 34046, 3554, '<td valign="top">Congratulations. Beautiful shot.</td>', 'Congratulations. Beautiful shot.', '2003-08-27 02:23:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(400623, 34140, 11347, '<td valign="top">Thanks to all those who voted. This was my first entry here at dpchallenge. It was quite interesting, I think I''ll give it another shot ;-)<br/>Im a bit surprised at some of those 1 and 3 votes though, thats pretty brutal. But it looks like the majority voted honestly.<br/> <br/>You can see more of my photography here <a href="//cydonian.com/gallery" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//cydonian.com/gallery</a> <br/> <br/>btw: I need a better camera :-)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-08-27 01:37:02.</i></td>', 'Thanks to all those who voted. This was my first entry here at dpchallenge. It was quite interesting, I think I''ll give it another shot ;-)Im a bit surprised at some of those 1 and 3 votes though, thats pretty brutal. But it looks like the majority voted honestly. You can see more of my photography here //cydonian.com/gallery  btw: I need a better camera :-)', '2003-08-27 02:27:07.000000', '2003-08-27 02:37:02.000000', 0),
(400645, 34041, 10084, '<td valign="top">Needs a bit more field of depth. It look like the everything is almost on the same plane. Some sky would add some depth also.</td>', 'Needs a bit more field of depth. It look like the everything is almost on the same plane. Some sky would add some depth also.', '2003-08-27 02:33:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(400654, 33912, 10084, '<td valign="top">Very colorful piece. Blurring out the window would be nice. The reflections coming off the it is a bit distracting. A polarized lense would help with this. Good composition.</td>', 'Very colorful piece. Blurring out the window would be nice. The reflections coming off the it is a bit distracting. A polarized lense would help with this. Good composition.', '2003-08-27 02:36:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(400655, 34260, 10218, '<td valign="top">This is one of the few shots I thought could get a ribbon.  The composition is just perfect.  Congratuations.</td>', 'This is one of the few shots I thought could get a ribbon.  The composition is just perfect.  Congratuations.', '2003-08-27 02:36:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(400671, 33584, 4258, '<td valign="top">Congrats on a well deserved Blue ribbon - a very lovely macro, I would have given it a 10 even though I have come to hate bugs now ;)</td>', 'Congrats on a well deserved Blue ribbon - a very lovely macro, I would have given it a 10 even though I have come to hate bugs now ;)', '2003-08-27 02:50:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(400681, 34046, 6405, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on the first Ribbon,next time blue one!</td>', 'Congratulations on the first Ribbon,next time blue one!', '2003-08-27 03:01:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(400683, 33779, 10124, '<td valign="top">Thank you to everyone who was able to appreciate my unconventional approach to this flower shot. I didn''t want it to be just a typical floral shot, hence the low angle and the cropping off of the main flower subject. I took many of these from different angles and noticed the surreal look I got from this low angle and tight crop and thought it was really interesting.</td>', 'Thank you to everyone who was able to appreciate my unconventional approach to this flower shot. I didn''t want it to be just a typical floral shot, hence the low angle and the cropping off of the main flower subject. I took many of these from different angles and noticed the surreal look I got from this low angle and tight crop and thought it was really interesting.', '2003-08-27 03:02:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(400696, 33584, 5475, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot, Kosta.  Congrats on the Blue!!<br/>JD Anderson</td>', 'Excellent shot, Kosta.  Congrats on the Blue!!JD Anderson', '2003-08-27 03:14:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(400711, 34333, 5728, '<td valign="top">Man you really got robbed on this shot. It was one of my favourites for the challenge.<br/> <br/>3 X 1''s and 7 X 2''s???? Come on voters, that is so insulting!</td>', 'Man you really got robbed on this shot. It was one of my favourites for the challenge. 3 X 1''s and 7 X 2''s???? Come on voters, that is so insulting!', '2003-08-27 03:40:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(400712, 33584, 5728, '<td valign="top">Strike! Congrats Kosta.</td>', 'Strike! Congrats Kosta.', '2003-08-27 03:41:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(400714, 34260, 5728, '<td valign="top">Way to go Tony! Congrats.</td>', 'Way to go Tony! Congrats.', '2003-08-27 03:42:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(400722, 34314, 6783, '<td valign="top">Conceptually very good.<br/>Technically, the rocks are overexposed and the back of the head of the child is too dark. Good composition, after all.</td>', 'Conceptually very good.Technically, the rocks are overexposed and the back of the head of the child is too dark. Good composition, after all.', '2003-08-27 04:11:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(400725, 34037, 3554, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the comments. This is my favorite shot of all I have submitted so far. I''m happy about how well it did.</td>', 'Thanks for all the comments. This is my favorite shot of all I have submitted so far. I''m happy about how well it did.', '2003-08-27 04:17:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(400728, 34260, 3554, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on the ribbon.  :)</td>', 'Congratulations on the ribbon.  :)', '2003-08-27 04:20:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(400730, 34359, 5475, '<td valign="top">Hello Sonja!<br/>Congrats on a top ten finish.  I love your family shots!<br/>JD Anderson</td>', 'Hello Sonja!Congrats on a top ten finish.  I love your family shots!JD Anderson', '2003-08-27 04:25:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(400733, 34331, 8054, '<td valign="top">Well, I posted a re-cropped version in my portfolio if anyone is interested.  :)</td>', 'Well, I posted a re-cropped version in my portfolio if anyone is interested.  :)', '2003-08-27 04:27:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(400739, 33841, 3554, '<td valign="top">Congrats on a top 10 finish! It was an excellent shot.</td>', 'Congrats on a top 10 finish! It was an excellent shot.', '2003-08-27 04:33:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(400742, 34041, 5475, '<td valign="top">Hi...<br/>I gave you a five on this shot...<br/>I think you have an interesting scene here, but the shot doesn''t draw me in...<br/>The details seem a little soft.  Could be a focus issue, or a post processing (downsize to submit, without sharpening??).<br/>Nice colors and you''ve got the potential for a fun shot.  Worth revisiting...<br/>JD Anderson</td>', 'Hi...I gave you a five on this shot...I think you have an interesting scene here, but the shot doesn''t draw me in...The details seem a little soft.  Could be a focus issue, or a post processing (downsize to submit, without sharpening??).Nice colors and you''ve got the potential for a fun shot.  Worth revisiting...JD Anderson', '2003-08-27 04:35:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(400743, 33853, 3554, '<td valign="top">The more I look at this one the more I like it.</td>', 'The more I look at this one the more I like it.', '2003-08-27 04:36:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(400753, 34260, 10848, '<td valign="top">congratulations! Great picture</td>', 'congratulations! Great picture', '2003-08-27 04:47:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(400756, 34308, 2567, '<td valign="top">I think you were robbed.  I liked the colors and composition.  Met the challenge in an interesting way.  Sorry for the low score.</td>', 'I think you were robbed.  I liked the colors and composition.  Met the challenge in an interesting way.  Sorry for the low score.', '2003-08-27 04:52:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(400758, 33654, 3554, '<td valign="top">Now what is this doing way down here?  Perhaps people not from the Western US just don''t appreciate how loudly this screams summer.</td>', 'Now what is this doing way down here?  Perhaps people not from the Western US just don''t appreciate how loudly this screams summer.', '2003-08-27 04:52:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(400759, 34046, 10848, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your ribbon...good job! :)</td>', 'Congratulations on your ribbon...good job! :)', '2003-08-27 04:53:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(400760, 33621, 3554, '<td valign="top">Well looks like we were on the same wave length. Apparently not everyone spent time just looking up into the clouds and day dreaming.</td>', 'Well looks like we were on the same wave length. Apparently not everyone spent time just looking up into the clouds and day dreaming.', '2003-08-27 04:55:55.000000', NULL, 0),
