(400940, 34305, 3102, '<td valign="top">Granted, the photo didn''t do very well, but I thought I''d wish you well if you''re afflicted with this terrible disease (I''m guessing you are, based on your username!).  My wife is recovering from surgery after learning she had cervical cancer this summer, so this certainly hits close to home.  Cancer has touched both sides of my family over the years -- I certainly hope they make some advances!  Anyway, best wishes to you.</td>', 'Granted, the photo didn''t do very well, but I thought I''d wish you well if you''re afflicted with this terrible disease (I''m guessing you are, based on your username!).  My wife is recovering from surgery after learning she had cervical cancer this summer, so this certainly hits close to home.  Cancer has touched both sides of my family over the years -- I certainly hope they make some advances!  Anyway, best wishes to you.', '2003-08-27 10:31:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(400969, 33621, 11243, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments, I agree, while it looks quite nice its pretty boring.. in fact it was taken at a bus stop in the city so a nice foreground wasn''t really available.. I guess if I''d got up off my lazy ass I could have got a much better shot.. wouls have been nice to see some pretty shapes in there too.</td>', 'Thanks for the comments, I agree, while it looks quite nice its pretty boring.. in fact it was taken at a bus stop in the city so a nice foreground wasn''t really available.. I guess if I''d got up off my lazy ass I could have got a much better shot.. wouls have been nice to see some pretty shapes in there too.', '2003-08-27 10:45:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(400973, 34046, 10510, '<td valign="top">Congratulations.  I loved this picture!  Almost looks like there is an angel standing in the center of the clouds.  Can you see it?</td>', 'Congratulations.  I loved this picture!  Almost looks like there is an angel standing in the center of the clouds.  Can you see it?', '2003-08-27 10:47:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(400978, 34301, 10510, '<td valign="top">Congratulations Andy!  Beautiful picture.</td>', 'Congratulations Andy!  Beautiful picture.', '2003-08-27 10:50:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(400989, 33912, 11111, '<td valign="top">Great color and subject here. Surprised it didn''t score higher! Summer''s a time when midwest kids run wild outside and get to go places like this. This is definitely summer! You might have scored higher if the reflections were in focus.? Who knows. I''m still practicing myself.</td>', 'Great color and subject here. Surprised it didn''t score higher! Summer''s a time when midwest kids run wild outside and get to go places like this. This is definitely summer! You might have scored higher if the reflections were in focus.? Who knows. I''m still practicing myself.', '2003-08-27 10:53:16.000000', NULL, 0),
