(401054, 34358, 11184, '<td valign="top">That was taken by the "Altoids" cam?  WOW! Amazing!  And looking at your portfolio shows you really seem to know how to use that little thing.  You should work for Pentax.</td>', 'That was taken by the "Altoids" cam?  WOW! Amazing!  And looking at your portfolio shows you really seem to know how to use that little thing.  You should work for Pentax.', '2003-08-27 11:15:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(401057, 34259, 8125, '<td valign="top">Thank you everyone for your very helpful comments.  This is great for my learning curve.  I figured the washed out sky would bring down the numbers on this one, but the rest of the photo turned out so great, I thought I''d give it a try.  I played a little bit with the adjustments to try and bring a little color to the sky, but it made the rest of the photo look worse, so I left it alone.<br/> <br/>Thank you again, I look forward to learning a lot from everyone here!</td>', 'Thank you everyone for your very helpful comments.  This is great for my learning curve.  I figured the washed out sky would bring down the numbers on this one, but the rest of the photo turned out so great, I thought I''d give it a try.  I played a little bit with the adjustments to try and bring a little color to the sky, but it made the rest of the photo look worse, so I left it alone. Thank you again, I look forward to learning a lot from everyone here!', '2003-08-27 11:16:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(401086, 33928, 11295, '<td valign="top">Hey - I wanted to say thanks to all of you who commented and voted. This was a first attempt, and I can see where this kind of feedback will be instrumental in improving my work as a photographer. I hope to offer better pics as we move along. :)<br/> <br/>As for lead in the hoses... yeech! I didn''t know that. I tell ya, there''s just no being a kid anymore. Yikes.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-08-27 10:26:23.</i></td>', 'Hey - I wanted to say thanks to all of you who commented and voted. This was a first attempt, and I can see where this kind of feedback will be instrumental in improving my work as a photographer. I hope to offer better pics as we move along. :) As for lead in the hoses... yeech! I didn''t know that. I tell ya, there''s just no being a kid anymore. Yikes.', '2003-08-27 11:25:15.000000', '2003-08-27 11:26:23.000000', 0),
(401105, 34253, 11022, '<td valign="top">The darkness is good as it depicts the storm, but the shot isn''t clear and appears very fuzzy to me.  Also, there is no way to know what season this is so it doesn''t make it as a seasonal shot for me.</td>', 'The darkness is good as it depicts the storm, but the shot isn''t clear and appears very fuzzy to me.  Also, there is no way to know what season this is so it doesn''t make it as a seasonal shot for me.', '2003-08-27 11:31:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(401118, 34260, 11073, '<td valign="top">should have placed higher. i love this shot.</td>', 'should have placed higher. i love this shot.', '2003-08-27 11:38:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(401130, 34253, 1031, '<td valign="top">Although your beach looks cold, there''s nothing emblematic of Winter about it (like snow, Christmas lights, etc.), and your title didn''t lead voters by the hand -- I might have called it "Winter Seascape" or "Surf Sans Snow" or something cleverer if I could think of it.<br/> <br/>It has a very painterly look to it -- you might try running the Canvas or a brushstroke filter on it and accentuate the effect.</td>', 'Although your beach looks cold, there''s nothing emblematic of Winter about it (like snow, Christmas lights, etc.), and your title didn''t lead voters by the hand -- I might have called it "Winter Seascape" or "Surf Sans Snow" or something cleverer if I could think of it. It has a very painterly look to it -- you might try running the Canvas or a brushstroke filter on it and accentuate the effect.', '2003-08-27 11:41:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(401179, 34206, 11206, '<td valign="top">Thanks to all who gave me advice and great comments.  I have taken into consideration for all.  It has truely been beneficial to me.  Thanks again.</td>', 'Thanks to all who gave me advice and great comments.  I have taken into consideration for all.  It has truely been beneficial to me.  Thanks again.', '2003-08-27 12:06:34.000000', NULL, 0),
