(401372, 34359, 3575, '<td valign="top">Sonja, will you please send your family to Seattle for a week, just so I can photograph them? You can come too. LOL! Not only do you have great subjects to photograph but your children are great models. It is obvious they bring you immense joy because it comes through in your photos and makes me feel good too.</td>', 'Sonja, will you please send your family to Seattle for a week, just so I can photograph them? You can come too. LOL! Not only do you have great subjects to photograph but your children are great models. It is obvious they bring you immense joy because it comes through in your photos and makes me feel good too.', '2003-08-27 13:39:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(401422, 34268, 9893, '<td valign="top">I gave this one a 6. Yes, its slightly too busy. But also I would have voted higher if it was perhaps taken closer to sunrise or sunset, because the lighting is rather harsh. Great use of framing though =)</td>', 'I gave this one a 6. Yes, its slightly too busy. But also I would have voted higher if it was perhaps taken closer to sunrise or sunset, because the lighting is rather harsh. Great use of framing though =)', '2003-08-27 14:03:06.000000', NULL, 0),
