(930997, 34358, 22734, '<td valign="top">This is a superb image where the sky carries you away. Most skies suffer lack of luminosity in relation to the rest of the image. Well, this sky shines with great beauty even in its subdued value due to the time of day. While the center horizon lights are not quite the eye puller, the earthly reward begins immediately below the pier. The water and reflections then match the upper beauty of the sky.</td>', 'This is a superb image where the sky carries you away. Most skies suffer lack of luminosity in relation to the rest of the image. Well, this sky shines with great beauty even in its subdued value due to the time of day. While the center horizon lights are not quite the eye puller, the earthly reward begins immediately below the pier. The water and reflections then match the upper beauty of the sky.', '2004-09-29 12:54:04.000000', NULL, 0),
